  "content": "<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">Это большой мод. Это RPG-мод (вдохновлённый Advent of Ascension, Divine RPG и Orespawn). Мод добавляет множество новых измерений, новых мобов, новую руду, новую броню, новое оружие и новое дальнобойное оружие.</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">Добавляет 37 комплектов новой брони</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">Добавляет более 200 новых предметов</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— бронекомплекты</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— инструменты и мечи</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— материалы</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">Добавляет более 200 новых блоков</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— блоки</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— ступени</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— плиты</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— заборы</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— стены</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— декоративные элементы (деревья, грибы)</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">Добавляет более 30 специальных видов оружия</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— мечи со способностями</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— огнестрельное оружие</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— волшебные жезлы</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">Добавляет КНИГУ ЛИЧНОСТИ</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— при входе в новый мир вы получаете книгу с 6 вариантами пресетов на выбор</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— воин</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— лучник</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— шахтёр</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— лесоруб</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— грифер</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— читер</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><span style=\"color:#000\">5 </span><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">новых боссов</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— CreepUltimate</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— Infinite Purp</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— MonSugar</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— Dark Tyrant</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">Всего добавлено более 120 новых мобов</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">Добавляет 5 измерений</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— Creepistonia</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— Purplishes</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— Бездна</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— Candyland</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">— Divine (в разработке)</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">18 зачарований</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">Если хотите (но не обязательно), вы можете отправить деньги, чтобы помочь мне продолжать обновлять этот мод и создавать новые. Спасибо!</span></strong></p><p style=\"color:#6e6779;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\"><span style=\"color:#b00112;background-color:#ffffff\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ascensionofthedivine\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/ascensionofthedivine</a></span></p>",
